{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-27T03:42:57.531Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"dc7907660f4d1b54f3ee01bc","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"probe"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"ops-input-startup-timeout"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Separate artifact-reader startup time from the bounded input-refusal deadline"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"The unchanged special-input regression in test/regular-input.test.ts hit its five-second child timeout in a two-worker full gate and an isolated one-worker retry. The npm serial full gate and PR CI passed unchanged. Its child imports the full SDK, package extension and all input consumers before exercising the input boundary, so the deadline includes cold startup. A diagnostic measured about 3.5 seconds of imports before the first refusal assertion; a full successful phase trace is still being collected. Do not infer a blocked FIFO read from the timeout alone."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":3},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":[]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-10-27T03:42:57.531Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-27T03:42:57.531Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"codex-agent"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Measure child readiness and input-refusal execution separately with bounded deadlines; Preserve real writerless FIFO, socket, device, directory and oversized-file assertions without weakening coverage thresholds; Demonstrate stable cold-start behavior under bounded te